#
# Module
#
ModuleEzGpaoName = EzGpao
EzGpaoDescription = Simplified production management: from kits to BOMs, from sales orders to manufacturing orders
EzGpaoDescriptionLong = Turns a kit into an autonomous bill of materials (BOM) and creates the manufacturing orders (MO) of a sales order.

#
# Kit -> BOM
#
EzGpaoConvertKitToBom = Convert kit into BOM
EzGpaoConvertKitToBomHelp = Creates a validated BOM from the kit composition, then removes that composition from the product
EzGpaoConfirmConvertKitToBom = A validated BOM will be created from the composition of kit <b>%s</b>, then the kit composition will be removed from the product. The BOM will not stay in sync with the former kit. Continue?
EzGpaoConvertKitsToBom = Convert kits into BOMs
EzGpaoConfirmConvertKitsToBom = A validated BOM will be created for each of the %s selected products that are kits, then their kit composition will be removed. Continue?
EzGpaoKitConverted = Kit %s converted into BOM %s
EzGpaoBomCreatedFromKit = BOM created from kit %s
EzGpaoProductsNotKits = Products skipped because they are not kits: %s
EzGpaoErrorNotAKit = Product %s is not a kit
EzGpaoErrorProductAlreadyHasBom = Product %s already has a validated BOM (%s): the kit was not converted
EzGpaoErrorComponentNotFound = Kit component not found (id %s)
EzGpaoErrorKitConversion = Conversion of kit %s failed:

#
# Sales order -> manufacturing orders
#
EzGpaoCreateMos = Create manufacturing orders
EzGpaoCreateMosHelp = Creates a draft manufacturing order for each line whose product has a validated BOM
EzGpaoConfirmCreateMos = A draft manufacturing order will be created for each line of order <b>%s</b> whose product has a validated BOM, for the ordered quantity. Continue?
EzGpaoMoLabel = Order %s - %s
EzGpaoMosCreated = %s manufacturing order(s) created for order %s: %s
EzGpaoLinesAlreadyCovered = Order %s: lines skipped because a manufacturing order is already linked to them: %s
EzGpaoLinesWithoutBom = Order %s: lines skipped for lack of a validated BOM: %s
EzGpaoNothingToManufacture = Order %s: no product line to manufacture
EzGpaoErrorOrderNotEligible = Order %s must be validated to create its manufacturing orders
EzGpaoErrorMoCreation = Creation of the manufacturing order of product %s failed:
